#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:4 499928b671e346f6b469df627ad75671
msgid "Weathervaning and Wind Hold"
msgstr "风向标与抗风保持"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:6 dfe72c40b37a484ba05f1507f2684e00
msgid ""
"Flying a Traditional Helicopter, or some Multicopters, in significant levels"
" of wind can present a challenge. The issue is that any flat plate surface, "
"such as a Traditional Helicopter's tail fin and boom, offers a lot of "
"surface area for the wind to interact with. That can lead to a reduction in "
"attitude and position control and high motor and ESC load."
msgstr ""
"在强风条件下飞行传统直升机或某些多旋翼是一大挑战。问题在于任何平板状表面（如传统直升机的尾翼和尾管）都为风提供了较大的受力面积，可能导致姿态和位置控制能力下降以及电机和"
" ESC 负载过高。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:11 312c4652dd384090a02dd81c0f57dfeb
msgid ""
"To reduce the impact of wind when flying in VTOL modes the ArduPilot code "
"supports active yaw axis weathervaning which can greatly reduce the impact "
"of wind on VTOL flight by keeping the vehicle pointed into the wind and "
"reducing the surface area exposed to the wind."
msgstr ""
"为降低在 VTOL 模式下飞行时风的影响，ArduPilot "
"代码支持主动偏航轴风向标功能，通过使飞行器机头始终迎风，减少暴露在风中的受力面积，从而大幅降低风对 VTOL 飞行的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:16 d5f9a6d4d59d484bb6675d650bc3fd26
msgid "Active Weathervaning"
msgstr "主动风向标"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:18 cc24240ebbac43d681fa1272fa32ae70
msgid ""
"Active weathervaning acts to turn the aircraft into the wind when flying in "
"GUIDED and/or AUTO modes. You can enable active weathervaning by setting the"
" :ref:`WVANE_ENABLE <WVANE_ENABLE>` parameter to a non-zero value and "
"selecting to use it in either GUIDED and/or AUTO modes. The default is not "
"to use active weathervaning."
msgstr ""
"主动风向标在 Guided 和/或 Auto 模式下飞行时使飞行器机头迎风。通过将 :ref:`WVANE_ENABLE <WVANE_ENABLE>`"
" 参数设置为非零值，并选择在 Guided 和/或 Auto 模式下使用，即可启用主动风向标功能。默认不使用主动风向标。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:24 c8e88c8ca8964f6e826b3e9c7b09409d
msgid ":ref:`WVANE_ENABLE<WVANE_ENABLE>` Value"
msgstr ":ref:`WVANE_ENABLE<WVANE_ENABLE>` 值"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:24 91ebce10815349f99ca5d704738ef906
msgid "Weathervane Direction"
msgstr "风向标方向"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:26 fde4f6b5ca404995b48432df2c38e84a
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:26 4d0d48046dbf473cb7e380e170bdebcf
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:28 b8320dea26ee4aa48cffe62238d880cb
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:28 de100a9e9279492c88a2863069b96a9f
msgid "Nose Into Wind(default)"
msgstr "机头迎风（默认）"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:30 c406ba8cd94948c39d93c5ff14f58c11
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:30 c2ef18db5f554a8fa753ea27b70326cb
msgid "Nose OR Tail Into Wind"
msgstr "机头或机尾迎风"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:32 a91f6d81042e404e8b57b1dfe15e8a1e
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:32 0701ce4c33e64311b0393ca678dde7a2
msgid "Side Into Wind"
msgstr "侧面迎风"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:34 83220a8399884dee99aedea584e08da4
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:34 81d4968a2cf743998d588eae4477ac81
msgid "Tail Into Wind"
msgstr "机尾迎风"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:37 cf4fecd489e948db8e0ca184177c03d8
msgid ""
"Then you must also enable it for GUIDED and/or AUTO mode by setting bit 7 of"
" the :ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` and/or "
":ref:`AUTO_OPTIONS<AUTO_OPTIONS>` parameter, respectively. It will not be "
"active in any other mode."
msgstr ""
"然后您还必须通过分别设置 :ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` 和/或 "
":ref:`AUTO_OPTIONS<AUTO_OPTIONS>` 参数的第 7 位来在 GUIDED 和/或 AUTO "
"模式下启用它。它在任何其他模式下都不会激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:40 42fdb456e64d4e9aac6baf8517328160
msgid ""
"enabling weathervaning will override any yaw specific control in missions, "
"such as pointing the nose to ROI targets, or responding to MAVLink YAW "
"positioning commands. If pilot yaw control is enabled, the pilot can change "
"the yaw, but as soon as pilot input ceases, the vehicle will yaw back to its"
" Weathervaing Direction set above."
msgstr ""
"启用风向标功能将覆盖任务中任何特定的偏航控制，例如将机头指向 ROI 目标，或响应 MAVLink "
"偏航定位命令。如果启用了飞手偏航控制，飞手可以更改偏航，但一旦飞手输入停止，飞行器将偏航回到上面设置的风向标方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:42 bbfa58681f32475b820ebd6f099e04a5
msgid ""
"The way it works is the autopilot looks at the roll and/or pitch attitude "
"needed to control the desired position. The basic algorithm is \"yaw into "
"the roll/pitch\". If the aircraft needs hold roll to the right in order to "
"hold position then it will turn in that direction on the assumption that the"
" right roll is needed in order to hold against the wind (assuming nose into "
"the wind). Similarly, for Side Into the Wind, it will use the pitch angle "
"and yaw appropriately, trying to zero the pitch required to hold position."
msgstr ""
"工作方式是飞控查看保持所需位置所需的横滚和/或俯仰姿态。基本算法是「朝横滚/俯仰方向偏航」。如果飞行器需要向右横滚以保持位置，则它将向该方向转向，假设需要向右横滚是为了抵抗风（假设机头迎风）。同样，对于侧面迎风，它将使用俯仰角并适当偏航，尝试将保持位置所需的俯仰降为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:48 6c28c7692cdf47a488403bff707c2081
msgid ""
"by default, weathervaning does not use pitch, only roll. This is to prevent "
"unwanted continuous yawing if the hover attitude has not been trimmed to "
"hover, in place, with no wind. If this **has** been done, then pitch driven "
"weathervaning can be enabled by setting :ref:`WVANE_OPTIONS<WVANE_OPTIONS>` "
"bit 0 to \"1\". This will speed weathervaning if positioned with the wind "
"blowing from behind (ie mostly being held in position with pitch, not roll)."
" This does not affect Side Into Wind, it always uses pitch, hover trim "
"attitude must be properly set for good operation."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，风向标功能不使用俯仰，只使用横滚。这是为了防止在悬停姿态未修整为无风悬停的情况下产生不必要的持续偏航。如果 **已经** "
"完成了修整，则可以通过将 :ref:`WVANE_OPTIONS<WVANE_OPTIONS>` 的第 0 "
"位设置为\"1\"来启用俯仰驱动的风向标功能。当风从后方吹来时（即主要通过俯仰而不是横滚保持位置），这将加速风向标功能。这不影响侧面迎风，侧面迎风始终使用俯仰，悬停修整姿态必须正确设置才能良好运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:50 87c5b18b26094632a136e9b2b7316df7
msgid ""
"How quickly the aircraft yaws is determined by the "
":ref:`WVANE_GAIN<WVANE_GAIN>` parameter. It converts the lean angle into "
"degs/sec of yaw. A good value to start with is 1 (1 degree roll = 1 deg/sec "
"yaw). Higher values will make the aircraft turn into the roll more quickly. "
"If the value is too high then you can get instability and oscillation in "
"yaw."
msgstr ""
"飞行器偏航的速度由 :ref:`WVANE_GAIN<WVANE_GAIN>` 参数决定。它将倾斜角度转换为度/秒的偏航速率。建议从 1 开始（1 "
"度横滚 = 1 度/秒偏航）。较高的值会使飞行器更快地转向横滚方向。如果值太高，则可能在偏航上产生不稳定性和振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:55 66346759ab7842e6a65d5233c919c921
msgid ""
"To cope with a small amount of trim in the aircraft there is an additional "
"parameter :ref:`WVANE_ANG_MIN<WVANE_ANG_MIN>` which controls the minimum "
"roll/pitch level before weathervaning will be used. This defaults to one "
"degree. If you find your aircraft starts yawing even in no wind then you may"
" need to raise this value."
msgstr ""
"为了应对飞行器的少量配平，还有一个额外参数 "
":ref:`WVANE_ANG_MIN<WVANE_ANG_MIN>`，它控制启用风向标功能之前的最低横滚/俯仰水平。默认值为 1 "
"度。如果您发现飞行器即使在无风时也开始偏航，您可能需要提高此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:61 c830a7e430464d66907baf11eb3e10ec
msgid ""
"There are a number of additional parameters that can control when "
"WeatherVaning is active (all are disabled by default):"
msgstr "有许多额外参数可以控制风向标效应的激活时机（所有默认禁用）："

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:63 c39304d1db334558bfb7644f88b66933
msgid ""
":ref:`WVANE_HGT_MIN<WVANE_HGT_MIN>`: above this height weathervaning is "
"permitted"
msgstr ":ref:`WVANE_HGT_MIN<WVANE_HGT_MIN>`：超过此高度时允许使用风向标功能"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:64 20fff9a761e842a0bc1ce394a01d1e26
msgid ""
":ref:`WVANE_SPD_MAX<WVANE_SPD_MAX>`: below this ground speed weathervaning "
"is permitted"
msgstr ":ref:`WVANE_SPD_MAX<WVANE_SPD_MAX>`：低于此地速时允许使用风向标功能"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:65 ffe2fe4c2073473281cabcb7458bc337
msgid ""
":ref:`WVANE_VELZ_MAX<WVANE_VELZ_MAX>`: maximum climb or descent speed at "
"which the vehicle will still attempt to weathervane"
msgstr ":ref:`WVANE_VELZ_MAX<WVANE_VELZ_MAX>`：飞行器仍然会尝试使用风向标功能的最大爬升或下降速度"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:66 eb889ee2fb014f3eace8a9f2498f014c
msgid ""
":ref:`WVANE_TAKEOFF<WVANE_TAKEOFF>`: override weathervaning direction in "
"auto takeoffs*"
msgstr ":ref:`WVANE_TAKEOFF<WVANE_TAKEOFF>`：在自动起飞中覆盖风向标方向*"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:67 4b3d384047b54ebbb05fd9b603d47ce5
msgid ""
":ref:`WVANE_LAND<WVANE_LAND>`: override weathervaning directions in auto "
"landings*"
msgstr ":ref:`WVANE_LAND<WVANE_LAND>`：在自动降落中覆盖风向标转向方向*"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:69 0411938930584ef0834281489021272a
msgid ""
"to allow weathervaning only on takeoffs and landing during an AUTO mission "
"or in GUIDED mode, set :ref:`WVANE_ENABLE<WVANE_ENABLE>` =0 but use the "
":ref:`WVANE_LAND<WVANE_LAND>` and/or :ref:`WVANE_TAKEOFF<WVANE_TAKEOFF>` "
"parameters to enable the weathervaning control."
msgstr ""
"要仅在 AUTO 任务或 GUIDED 模式下的起飞和降落期间允许风向标功能，设置 :ref:`WVANE_ENABLE<WVANE_ENABLE>` "
"=0，但使用 :ref:`WVANE_LAND<WVANE_LAND>` 和/或 :ref:`WVANE_TAKEOFF<WVANE_TAKEOFF>`"
" 参数来启用风向标控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/weathervaning.rst:71 de0d2e1ffd7d43859656fbfc8ae4d2e6
msgid ""
"Weathervaning can be disabled or enabled by an :ref:`RC Aux Function "
"Switch<common-auxiliary-functions>`, option \"160\""
msgstr "风向标功能可以通过 :ref:`RC 辅助功能开关<common-auxiliary-functions>` 选项\"160\"来禁用或启用"
